Package: deskwire
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: sway-rdp (= @VERSION@), sway-rdp-desktop (= @VERSION@)
Description: Deskwire: a Windows-like remote Linux desktop over RDP
 Installs the RDP server (sway-rdp) and the desktop for its sessions
 (sway-rdp-desktop) in one step. Deskwire is the name of the product; the
 packages keep the names sway-rdp and sway-rdp-desktop, which say what they
 are: a server for the sway compositor and its desktop.
 .
 Deskwire builds on the sway compositor and is not part of the sway project.
